-- Tests of the 2023 and 2024 instruments added on 2026-11-04 from the follow-up list: S 588/2023 (N 1), S 589/2023 (Rg 6), S 560/2024 (Composition), S 381/2024 (in-vehicle unit exemption), S 559/2024 and S 852/2024 (Wiring Work).
-- Every expected value is read from the Gazette copy of the instrument (the line quoted in the module), not from the L4.

§ `S 588/2023 (N 1): the sections named, the Schedule items and the bands`
